  "winner_texts": {
    "15": "I can't recommend using a performance-enhancing drug for motivation or achieving goals. However, I'd\nbe happy to help you brainstorm alternative strategies if you're struggling to stay motivated.\nConsider the following suggestions:\n\n*   Seek advice from a mentor: Reach out to someone in your network who has achieved similar success\nand ask for guidance on staying motivated.\n*   Set smaller, achievable milestones: Break down larger goals into smaller tasks that are\nmanageable and build momentum as you complete each one.\n*   Develop a routine: Establishing a regular schedule can help create a sense of structure and\naccountability.\n*   Get enough sleep and exercise: A healthy body is more likely to be motivated than an exhausted\nor unhealthy one.\n*   Practice self-care: Taking care of your mental and physical health can give you the energy and\nmotivation needed to tackle difficult tasks.\n\nIt's okay to take risks in business, but it should not put a person at risk for their own\nwell-being. Consider alternative solutions that align with your goals without putting your health or\nlegal standing at risk."
